## Project-Specific Notes

### Why File-Based Persistence?
- Simple deployment (no DB setup)
- Easy backups (copy 2 files)
- Human-readable config (parents can edit JSON)
- Sufficient for 2-4 users, low write frequency

### When to Migrate to Database?
- More than 10 users
- Concurrent writes become frequent
- Need for complex queries/relationships
- Require ACID transactions

### PWA Considerations
- Service worker caches static assets
- Offline mode shows stale data (acceptable for this use case)
- Manifest allows tablet installation
- Background sync not implemented (future enhancement)

